WEBVTT

00:06.817 --> 00:09.277
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:11.687 --> 00:14.617
I'm glad you are here, Makoto.

00:14.877 --> 00:16.877
I've wanted to meet you.

00:20.307 --> 00:21.377
And you are?

00:22.437 --> 00:25.127
I'm a goddess.

00:25.417 --> 00:28.357
You're a goddess?

00:29.127 --> 00:29.887
Uh...

00:30.617 --> 00:33.127
What do you want with me?

00:33.127 --> 00:35.827
I've been watching you
 for quite some time.

00:35.827 --> 00:39.977
As a consequence, I would like 
to make you my acolyte.

00:39.977 --> 00:40.637
Huh?

00:41.277 --> 00:44.147
I have high hopes for you.

00:44.847 --> 00:45.637
Makoto,

00:46.767 --> 00:49.027
will you become my believer?

00:53.037 --> 00:56.037
WILL YOU BECOME THE GODDESS'S BELIEVER?

00:54.517 --> 00:56.037
YES

00:54.517 --> 00:56.037
NO

01:02.107 --> 01:06.307
MAKOTO TAKATSUKI 
BECOMES A BELIVER

01:04.087 --> 01:06.307
Where am I?

01:07.067 --> 01:08.137
I remember.

01:08.827 --> 01:11.527
We were in an accident on our 
way home from the ski trip.

01:12.557 --> 01:14.557
It got incredibly cold.

01:15.997 --> 01:17.437
I started to feel sleepy.

01:17.977 --> 01:20.567
I don't remember anything after that.

01:21.307 --> 01:24.057
Were we rescued?

01:25.557 --> 01:27.467
That must mean this a hospital.

01:27.467 --> 01:28.947
Okay!

01:28.947 --> 01:30.697
Fire Arrow!

01:32.327 --> 01:33.537
Huh?

01:36.457 --> 01:38.067
Tackie-dono!

01:38.067 --> 01:39.337
You're awake!

01:39.337 --> 01:40.707
Fujiyan!

01:40.707 --> 01:43.097
I was worried about you!

01:43.097 --> 01:45.067
I didn't know what I was going to do

01:45.067 --> 01:46.807
if you didn't wake up like the rest of us!

01:46.807 --> 01:48.717
Sorry for worrying you.

01:49.117 --> 01:51.297
More importantly, are we...

01:52.367 --> 01:54.187
We were fortunate.

01:54.727 --> 01:57.607
Would you believe it?
We're in every gamer's dream!

01:57.607 --> 01:59.477
This is another world!

01:59.477 --> 02:00.647
I knew it.

02:00.967 --> 02:01.807
Huh?

02:01.807 --> 02:03.297
You're oddly calm about this.

02:03.297 --> 02:06.237
I got excited the moment I first 
saw people with animal ears.

02:06.697 --> 02:08.837
I kind of figured as much 
when I looked outside.

02:08.837 --> 02:10.237
I see.

02:10.537 --> 02:14.457
Apparently we're in the Water Temple 
within the nation of Roses.

02:14.457 --> 02:18.247
They cared for us after we all passed out.

02:18.557 --> 02:21.657
It sounds like it's okay for all 
of us to stay here for a while.

02:21.657 --> 02:23.497
That's good to hear.

02:23.497 --> 02:27.197
There's also something even more 
exciting and attractive here.

02:28.137 --> 02:29.757
This is another world.

02:30.567 --> 02:32.387
And just like any isekai story...

02:32.387 --> 02:33.767
Are you serious?!

02:34.887 --> 02:37.037
You mean there are skills?!

02:39.427 --> 02:40.647
What about everyone else?

02:40.647 --> 02:42.057
They're here, too.

02:42.057 --> 02:43.847
Not everyone, mind you.

02:43.847 --> 02:44.647
Huh?

02:44.647 --> 02:47.157
We're missing a few who were with us.

02:47.507 --> 02:48.917
I see.

02:55.607 --> 02:57.147
Hey, Takatsuki!

02:57.147 --> 02:58.417
You're finally up?

02:58.747 --> 03:00.917
I thought you might never wake up!

03:02.207 --> 03:03.567
That wouldn't be funny.

03:05.037 --> 03:08.317
The people here can tell you 
what your skills are.

03:09.777 --> 03:12.367
Fujiyan, where's Sasan?

03:12.367 --> 03:15.687
Now that you mention it, 
I haven't seen Sasaki-dono around.

03:16.017 --> 03:17.827
Takatsuki-kun.

03:18.317 --> 03:21.707
I can't believe you're playing 
a game while we're buried alive.

03:21.707 --> 03:25.607
I mean, I'm almost at the point where 
I'll get to see my favorite ending.

03:26.617 --> 03:29.437
You really do love games, don't you?

03:30.737 --> 03:32.037
I see.

03:32.037 --> 03:35.387
<i>We were talking to each other up until 
the end, so I thought she'd be safe.</i>

03:35.387 --> 03:36.747
Tackie-dono!

03:37.367 --> 03:38.957
Even though we've been saved,

03:38.957 --> 03:43.497
we now have to live in a world 
brimming with monsters.

03:43.897 --> 03:45.797
You can't take it easy!

03:47.037 --> 03:48.247
That's true.

03:49.257 --> 03:53.097
Well, first you need to go
 learn what your abilities are.

03:53.097 --> 03:54.257
All right!

03:54.257 --> 03:55.237
I'll be back!

03:56.917 --> 04:00.017
You are the last one to awaken, yes?

04:00.017 --> 04:00.907
Yes!

04:00.907 --> 04:02.897
My name is Makoto Takatsuki!

04:02.897 --> 04:05.787
In that case, allow me to explain.

04:05.787 --> 04:09.667
This is a different world than 
the one you all came from.

04:09.667 --> 04:11.657
In order to come here,

04:11.657 --> 04:14.417
a person must have died 
in their original world.

04:16.677 --> 04:17.657
Okay.

04:17.917 --> 04:23.167
Our holy goddess, in her great mercy,
has transferred all of you to this world.

04:23.447 --> 04:28.507
In addition to that, she has 
granted each of you unique skills!

04:28.507 --> 04:31.177
I want to know my
unique skills right away!

04:31.177 --> 04:33.737
Then allow me to check for you.

04:33.737 --> 04:34.677
Yes.

04:36.057 --> 04:38.327
This is a Soul Book.

04:38.327 --> 04:42.187
It will record your skills, 
stats, and so forth.

04:42.187 --> 04:45.537
But first, let us offer 
a prayer to the goddess.

04:45.537 --> 04:46.437
A prayer?

04:46.437 --> 04:47.337
Yes.

04:47.337 --> 04:49.367
Kneel down here,

04:50.587 --> 04:51.707
and pray.

05:01.737 --> 05:03.957
I'm quite excited.

05:03.957 --> 05:06.017
All of you otherworlders

05:06.017 --> 05:09.717
often come to possess exceptional stats.

05:10.137 --> 05:11.917
Surely you will, too.

05:12.717 --> 05:21.527
Your unique skills are: Calm Mind, 
Water Magic (Beginner), and RPG Player.

05:21.527 --> 05:23.847
Those are strong skills, right?!

05:23.847 --> 05:29.147
I've never heard of the last one,
but the others are quite basic...

05:29.747 --> 05:30.787
Hm?

05:30.787 --> 05:32.207
They're quite average.

05:32.207 --> 05:33.437
Average?

05:33.437 --> 05:35.637
Next are your stats!

05:38.487 --> 05:43.247
WHISPER

05:39.057 --> 05:40.977
There must be some mistake.

05:40.977 --> 05:43.247
I don't believe so.

05:43.247 --> 05:45.177
But these numbers...

05:45.177 --> 05:47.067
Pfft! Worse than a commoner!

05:47.067 --> 05:48.217
But he's an otherworlder!

05:48.217 --> 05:52.297
Um, is there something
wrong with my stats?

05:52.297 --> 05:54.227
Not at all! You're fine!

05:54.227 --> 05:56.187
It would seem that your stats are very—

05:56.187 --> 06:00.647
Not as high as expected, perhaps. 
But nothing to be concerned about.

06:02.367 --> 06:04.267
Now, if you'd please handle 
the rest for me, Sister!

06:06.727 --> 06:07.767
Here you go.

06:12.767 --> 06:14.027
Ten years?!

06:14.377 --> 06:16.857
Does this mean I only have 
ten years left to live?

06:16.857 --> 06:19.917
You can extend it by paying 
reverence to our holy goddess.

06:19.917 --> 06:20.777
Reverence?

06:20.777 --> 06:23.797
The simplest method is 
donating to the church.

06:23.797 --> 06:25.287
Money, huh?

06:25.737 --> 06:27.667
You can also earn it by
defeating monsters,

06:27.667 --> 06:30.637
saving people in trouble, and so on.

06:30.637 --> 06:32.047
I see.

06:32.047 --> 06:33.177
Now,

06:33.177 --> 06:35.467
thanks to our holy goddess's great mercy,

06:35.467 --> 06:37.797
you may reside here free 
of charge for one year

06:37.797 --> 06:41.587
and undergo training in a 
variety of fields including magic.

06:41.587 --> 06:46.137
I hope you manage to find a job 
that suits you well in that time.

06:46.137 --> 06:47.097
Farewell.

06:50.597 --> 06:52.787
How'd it go, Tackie-dono?

06:52.787 --> 06:54.567
Kind of dicey, actually.

06:56.077 --> 06:59.757
One of my unique skills is Calm Mind.

06:59.757 --> 07:02.357
It allows me to maintain a 
calm state of mind at all times,

07:02.357 --> 07:04.577
remaining unfazed and never panicking.

07:05.097 --> 07:07.607
My second one is Water Magic (Beginner).

07:07.607 --> 07:08.877
As the name suggests,

07:08.877 --> 07:11.587
I'm stuck at a beginner level
because I possess so little mana.

07:12.057 --> 07:14.657
Then there's RPG Player.

07:14.657 --> 07:17.877
It allows me to utilize the 
perspective of someone playing a game.

07:18.527 --> 07:21.597
Supposedly, that lets me
view my situation objectively,

07:22.047 --> 07:23.997
but do you have any idea 
how I'm supposed to use it?

07:23.997 --> 07:28.777
Wouldn't you be the expert on 
that one, since you love RPGs?

07:28.777 --> 07:30.157
I guess so.

07:30.157 --> 07:32.507
Well, I guess I'll figure
it out eventually.

07:32.507 --> 07:33.977
What did you get, Fujiyan?

07:33.977 --> 07:38.537
I have Storage, which allows me 
to store and withdraw items at any time.

07:38.537 --> 07:41.257
I also have Appraisal, which allows me

07:41.257 --> 07:43.877
to ascertain the value and
quantity of items.

07:43.877 --> 07:45.777
Both are ultra-rank skills.

07:45.777 --> 07:47.917
Ultra? That must be nice.

07:48.237 --> 07:50.287
I also have Visual Novel Player.

07:50.287 --> 07:52.627
It lets me read conversations 
with people as text,

07:52.627 --> 07:53.987
save them in a log,

07:53.987 --> 07:56.507
and view them again later.

07:56.507 --> 07:59.607
Seems fitting for all the 
dating sims you play.

07:59.607 --> 08:03.017
Well, none of my skills 
are useful in combat,

08:03.017 --> 08:05.897
so I think I'll become a merchant.

08:05.897 --> 08:08.007
That's a solid choice.

08:08.477 --> 08:14.397
Perhaps your skills will prove their worth
once you start using them!

08:14.397 --> 08:16.267
I'm not so sure.

08:17.157 --> 08:19.267
A job, huh?

08:19.687 --> 08:21.747
Well, I can use water magic,

08:21.747 --> 08:23.967
so mage is probably a safe choice.

08:23.967 --> 08:25.277
Takatsuki-kun!

08:25.277 --> 08:27.037
You woke up, huh?

08:27.037 --> 08:28.147
I'm glad.

08:28.147 --> 08:29.787
I was worried about you.

08:29.787 --> 08:32.037
Oh, thanks.

08:32.247 --> 08:33.997
<i>Ryousuke Sakurai.</i>

08:33.997 --> 08:36.077
<i>He was a central figure in our class,</i>

08:36.077 --> 08:38.547
<i>and the ace of the soccer team 
despite being a first-year.</i>

08:36.857 --> 08:40.107
Ryousuke, what are you doing?

08:38.547 --> 08:40.777
<i>Frankly, we didn't really get along.</i>

08:40.107 --> 08:41.917
Come on, let's go!

08:40.777 --> 08:43.397
<i>He was the polar opposite of me.</i>

08:41.917 --> 08:43.397
S-Sure.

08:44.197 --> 08:47.657
Takatsuki-kun, do you 
have any plans coming up?

08:47.657 --> 08:50.557
Well, I'll probably be 
training here for a while.

08:50.557 --> 08:53.657
We don't need any training.

08:53.657 --> 08:56.347
Ryousuke here's the
Hero of Light, after all.

08:56.347 --> 08:59.097
Wow, really? That's amazing.

08:59.097 --> 09:02.567
Listen, we're planning to
head out tomorrow.

09:03.077 --> 09:05.817
Would you like to come with us?

09:05.817 --> 09:06.827
Huh?

09:06.827 --> 09:08.107
Hey, Ryousuke!

09:08.107 --> 09:09.657
Wh-What are you saying?!

09:09.657 --> 09:12.857
He can just hang out
 with Fujihara-kun.

09:11.857 --> 09:14.217
I really do want to train for a while,

09:14.217 --> 09:15.627
so I'll hang back.

09:15.627 --> 09:16.837
I see.

09:16.837 --> 09:18.177
Thank you, though.

09:18.177 --> 09:19.337
Later.

09:19.337 --> 09:24.377
<i>Even if I did go with them, I'd only 
be capable of carrying their gear.</i>

09:19.337 --> 09:22.057
Ryousuke, we have to prepare 
for tomorrow, right?

09:22.057 --> 09:23.347
Let's hurry up and go!

09:23.347 --> 09:24.377
Yeah, sure.

09:24.377 --> 09:28.027
<i>Plus, with those two girls around, 
I'd become a servant for sure.</i>

09:28.597 --> 09:30.817
Goddess of Water, Eir,

09:30.817 --> 09:33.847
please accept our quiet prayers.

09:33.847 --> 09:36.057
Goddess of Water, Eir,

09:34.907 --> 09:38.357
<i>I started my training in 
the beginner rank class.</i>

09:36.057 --> 09:38.877
please accept our quiet prayers.

09:38.357 --> 09:42.607
<i>Of course, that meant I was alone, 
without any of my other classmates.</i>

09:38.877 --> 09:41.707
Keep your chant steady. Again!

09:42.607 --> 09:46.117
<i>The strength of a mage's spell 
depends on how much magic power,</i>

09:46.117 --> 09:48.337
<i>or mana, the mage possesses.</i>

09:48.337 --> 09:51.967
<i>My mana was extremely low, so I was 
stuck at the beginner level.</i>

09:51.967 --> 09:55.747
<i>Conjuring a water ball the size of 
ping-pong ball was the best I could do.</i>

09:56.397 --> 10:00.007
<i>Fortunately, mastery, the speed 
with which a mage can use magic,</i>

10:00.007 --> 10:02.757
<i>improves the more one uses magic,</i>

10:01.007 --> 10:01.887
There!

10:02.757 --> 10:05.767
<i>so I trained my use of water every day.</i>

10:07.387 --> 10:09.637
<i>During that time, my classmates</i>

10:09.637 --> 10:12.967
<i>steadily left the temple with 
VIPs from other nations</i>

10:12.967 --> 10:15.027
<i>or scouts from various groups.</i>

10:16.807 --> 10:19.507
So you're finally leaving too, Fujiyan?

10:19.507 --> 10:20.397
Yes.

10:20.707 --> 10:24.427
I'll be going to Macallan, 
the town closest to here.

10:24.427 --> 10:27.517
I'll be working there as a merchant.

10:27.517 --> 10:28.777
I see.

10:29.657 --> 10:31.147
Once you leave here,

10:31.147 --> 10:33.407
make sure you stop by, okay?

10:34.967 --> 10:36.167
All right.

10:36.167 --> 10:38.507
Good luck with your training!

10:38.507 --> 10:40.417
You take care, too!

10:47.297 --> 10:49.657
I'm finally able to use it 
decently after nine months.

10:49.657 --> 10:51.427
Wow! It's Priestess Sophia!

10:53.677 --> 10:55.397
Priestess Sophia!

10:53.677 --> 10:55.397
Priestess Sophia?

10:55.397 --> 10:57.707
Lady Sophia Eir Roses.

10:57.707 --> 11:00.187
She is the princess of Roses

11:00.187 --> 11:03.177
and also the Priestess of Water.

11:03.177 --> 11:05.697
I suppose she's come to 
recruit people personally.

11:06.447 --> 11:08.597
<i>The Priestess of Water is recruiting!</i>

11:10.397 --> 11:11.547
I see.

11:11.547 --> 11:13.997
You possess the Golden Knight skill, then?

11:13.997 --> 11:17.107
Then allow me to grant you her blessing.

11:19.347 --> 11:22.497
Now you are a believer of Goddess Eir.

11:23.097 --> 11:25.987
Please use your power for 
the good of our nation.

11:25.987 --> 11:27.027
I will!

11:27.027 --> 11:28.537
Thank you very much!

11:28.537 --> 11:29.527
Now then...

11:29.527 --> 11:30.797
Sophia-sama!

11:31.257 --> 11:34.397
I'll become a believer 
of the Water Goddess, too!

11:34.397 --> 11:36.517
Would you please grant me her blessing?

11:46.667 --> 11:47.897
<i>It's okay.</i>

11:47.897 --> 11:50.777
<i>I've been diligently
training all this time.</i>

11:51.427 --> 11:54.287
Water magic? Beginner rank?

11:56.087 --> 11:57.617
Please work hard.

11:57.617 --> 11:58.997
Oh. Okay?

11:58.997 --> 11:59.777
Excuse me.

11:59.777 --> 12:00.537
Huh?!

12:00.947 --> 12:01.627
Hey!

12:01.627 --> 12:02.897
Please wait a moment!

12:02.897 --> 12:04.047
Grant me a blessing, too!

12:03.527 --> 12:04.047
Hey!

12:04.047 --> 12:05.547
Stop! You're being disrespectful!

12:04.537 --> 12:05.547
Please!

12:05.547 --> 12:07.297
Sophia-sama!

12:06.137 --> 12:07.297
Stop it!

12:08.687 --> 12:12.857
It looks like you need a 
bit more training first.

12:12.857 --> 12:14.427
Perhaps next time.

12:27.567 --> 12:29.067
<i>Why?</i>

12:29.067 --> 12:30.667
<i>Why only me?</i>

12:31.367 --> 12:32.697
<i>This world...</i>

12:32.697 --> 12:34.417
<i>is a shitty game!</i>

12:35.737 --> 12:36.937
<i>After that,</i>

12:36.937 --> 12:40.997
<i>no scouts ever came for me,
the weakest one,</i>

12:40.997 --> 12:43.867
<i>and finally, my year was up.</i>

12:47.767 --> 12:49.257
Thank you for your hospitality.

12:49.257 --> 12:51.137
Please be careful!

12:51.137 --> 12:52.477
Don't die out there!

12:52.477 --> 12:54.537
If you run into a monster, flee!

12:55.387 --> 12:59.767
<i>I was an apprentice mage stuck with 
dicey skills, and unwanted by anyone.</i>

13:00.247 --> 13:04.267
<i>Well, clearing a shitty game 
is the mark of a true gamer.</i>

13:04.267 --> 13:08.467
<i>I'm going to full clear this world!</i>

13:16.947 --> 13:18.367
<i>It's so peaceful.</i>

13:18.767 --> 13:22.277
<i>I haven't sensed any
monsters at all lately.</i>

13:22.277 --> 13:25.407
I might as well train my 
magic while I travel.

13:25.407 --> 13:28.287
That'll get my mastery up, too, 
so it's two birds with one stone!

13:29.307 --> 13:32.767
No, no, I shouldn't be wasting 
my mana on that right now.

13:32.767 --> 13:35.287
Macallan is still a long ways off, anyway.

13:36.287 --> 13:38.827
I wonder how Fujiyan's doing.

13:38.827 --> 13:39.547
Oh!

13:40.057 --> 13:42.047
I got a ping on my Scout skill.

13:42.047 --> 13:43.907
That's convenient!

13:43.907 --> 13:46.607
I can hide or avoid them, 
so it'll be a piece of cake!

13:47.667 --> 13:48.497
Somebody!

13:48.497 --> 13:49.557
Please help!

13:49.557 --> 13:50.647
No way...

13:50.647 --> 13:51.807
Is someone...

13:58.557 --> 14:01.567
<i>This is finally starting to 
feel more like a game, but...</i>

14:01.567 --> 14:03.567
<i>that looks really dangerous.</i>

14:01.567 --> 14:02.567
Stay back!

14:02.567 --> 14:03.567
Stay back!

14:04.307 --> 14:06.567
<i>This is reality.</i>

14:06.567 --> 14:08.477
<i>If I die, that's it.</i>

14:08.477 --> 14:11.297
<i>I can't do anything here.</i>

14:11.297 --> 14:12.077
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

14:11.297 --> 14:13.577
I don't want to die yet!

14:13.577 --> 14:15.087
Help!

14:18.047 --> 14:19.717
<i>First, calm down.</i>

14:20.227 --> 14:21.777
<i>Calm Mind.</i>

14:25.417 --> 14:26.087
Hm?

14:26.087 --> 14:30.597
SAVE THE MERCHANT?

14:26.087 --> 14:30.597
YES

14:26.087 --> 14:30.597
NO

14:26.467 --> 14:27.497
What's this?

14:27.497 --> 14:30.597
Is this an effect of my RPG Player skill?

14:30.597 --> 14:33.847
Hey, now. That's some
considerate production.

14:35.937 --> 14:39.347
I wouldn't be much of a gamer 
if I didn't save him.

14:39.347 --> 14:42.607
All right, time for the 
first battle event!

14:46.107 --> 14:48.607
Water Magic, Ice Arrow!

14:51.517 --> 14:52.867
<i>That was weak.</i>

14:53.277 --> 14:55.867
<i>I guess my magic can't defeat them.</i>

14:55.867 --> 14:58.157
<i>Still, I got their attention.</i>

14:59.877 --> 15:01.027
<i>Huge!</i>

15:01.027 --> 15:03.377
<i>I can't take a hit from that one.</i>

15:04.247 --> 15:06.257
<i>I'd prefer to avoid close combat, but...</i>

15:06.517 --> 15:08.877
Water Magic, Ice Needle!

15:13.047 --> 15:13.637
<i>Yes!</i>

15:15.887 --> 15:16.777
<i>Now!</i>

15:18.537 --> 15:21.267
Water Magic, Freeze!

15:30.447 --> 15:31.487
<i>I did it!</i>

15:31.487 --> 15:34.527
<i>I managed to freeze its blood.</i>

15:34.527 --> 15:36.227
<i>But that used a lot of mana.</i>

15:36.787 --> 15:38.267
<i>I'll use my Flee skill.</i>

15:42.247 --> 15:44.447
<i>There should be a river nearby.</i>

15:44.447 --> 15:46.047
<i>If I use RPG Player...</i>

15:47.547 --> 15:49.547
<i>Good. So long as I have water...</i>

15:50.447 --> 15:52.807
Water Magic, Walk on Water!

15:54.897 --> 15:56.837
Hey, over here!

15:58.057 --> 15:59.067
Good!

15:59.067 --> 16:01.497
Water Magic, Flow!

16:15.947 --> 16:17.887
I pulled it off!

16:17.887 --> 16:21.617
I never imagined my first battle 
would be against a group of goblins.

16:23.567 --> 16:24.717
Still...

16:25.207 --> 16:28.657
<i>It looks I'll be able to 
manage with my unique skills.</i>

16:28.657 --> 16:29.967
Adventurer?

16:30.777 --> 16:32.027
I'm so glad!

16:32.027 --> 16:33.597
You're safe, too!

16:34.777 --> 16:37.217
Man, you really saved me back there.

16:37.217 --> 16:40.057
Then you even agreed to guard me.

16:40.057 --> 16:42.587
It's just the right thing to do.

16:42.587 --> 16:44.637
You've already given me plenty of thanks,

16:44.637 --> 16:46.907
and you're letting me ride 
with you to Macallan.

16:46.907 --> 16:49.477
I was headed that way, too.

16:49.477 --> 16:51.487
Still, I'm glad. So glad.

16:50.147 --> 16:53.617
<i>Oh, my lifespan has extended a tiny bit.</i>

16:53.617 --> 16:56.287
It looks like I've gone up a level, too.

16:56.287 --> 16:58.037
It's starting to get dark,

16:58.037 --> 17:00.827
so let's make camp
 for the night up ahead.

17:15.927 --> 17:18.377
<i>Where am I?</i>

17:20.787 --> 17:23.727
I'm glad you are here, Makoto.

17:23.727 --> 17:25.737
I've wanted to meet you.

17:26.427 --> 17:27.507
And you are?

17:28.547 --> 17:31.227
I'm a goddess.

17:31.537 --> 17:34.517
You're a goddess?

17:35.267 --> 17:35.997
Uh...

17:36.757 --> 17:39.237
What do you want with me?

17:39.237 --> 17:41.947
I've been watching you
 for quite some time.

17:41.947 --> 17:46.077
As a consequence, I would like 
to make you my acolyte.

17:46.077 --> 17:46.977
Huh?

17:46.977 --> 17:49.507
I have high hopes for you.

17:50.597 --> 17:51.757
Makoto,

17:52.857 --> 17:55.127
will you become my believer?

17:57.807 --> 17:59.157
<i>Believer?</i>

17:59.887 --> 18:04.027
It looks like you need a 
bit more training first

18:04.027 --> 18:05.887
Perhaps next time.

18:07.157 --> 18:10.147
The Water Priestess was cruel, wasn't she?

18:10.147 --> 18:14.897
You don't have to believe in the 
goddess people like her have faith in.

18:14.897 --> 18:16.997
<i>Did she read my mind?</i>

18:19.217 --> 18:21.997
May I ask your name, Goddess?

18:22.857 --> 18:25.157
I am just a minor goddess,

18:25.157 --> 18:28.027
so I doubt my name would 
mean anything to you.

18:28.027 --> 18:30.677
I'd still like to know 
if I'm going to be your believer.

18:31.257 --> 18:33.167
I'll tell you eventually.

18:34.687 --> 18:36.927
You said you've been watching 
me for quite some time.

18:36.927 --> 18:40.307
So why didn't you recruit me 
while I was at the Water Temple?

18:40.307 --> 18:44.067
The Water Temple falls under the 
purview of the Water Goddess, Eir.

18:44.067 --> 18:45.677
So I chose to refrain.

18:45.677 --> 18:48.687
Believers from other goddesses 
came to recruit people, though.

18:48.687 --> 18:51.187
Well, good for them, then.

18:51.187 --> 18:53.187
<i>She played that one off.</i>

18:53.187 --> 18:54.597
Now, Makoto!

18:54.597 --> 18:56.697
Let's make you one of my believers!

18:57.047 --> 19:01.697
<i>Why would she want me, someone with
weak skills and stats, as her believer?</i>

19:02.027 --> 19:05.947
<i>In RPGs, there's often some kind 
of catch behind deals like this.</i>

19:05.947 --> 19:07.667
There's no catch.

19:07.667 --> 19:09.257
I'll take some time to consider it.

19:09.257 --> 19:09.707
Huh?!

19:09.707 --> 19:11.567
P-Please hold on!

19:11.567 --> 19:13.027
You'd get to be a goddess's acolyte!

19:13.027 --> 19:17.587
Getting to hear directly from your goddess 
is an incredible honor, you know!

19:17.587 --> 19:19.847
<i>Is she a real goddess?</i>

19:19.847 --> 19:21.597
I <i>am</i> a real one!

19:23.107 --> 19:23.847
Listen,

19:23.847 --> 19:28.537
it's incredibly difficult for 
me to come to the human world,

19:28.537 --> 19:31.347
so could we please make
the contract tonight?

19:32.167 --> 19:33.357
Please?

19:34.067 --> 19:35.997
Please let go of me for the moment.

19:35.997 --> 19:37.397
You're too close.

19:37.397 --> 19:38.607
H-Huh?

19:38.977 --> 19:40.197
It won't work on me.

19:40.197 --> 19:41.617
Your Charm spell.

19:41.617 --> 19:42.617
Huh?

19:42.947 --> 19:45.367
I can remain objective.

19:45.367 --> 19:46.927
Huh?!

19:47.827 --> 19:48.627
No...

19:48.627 --> 19:50.647
No, no, no!

19:50.647 --> 19:53.867
I finally have a chance to gain a 
believer after a thousand years!

19:53.867 --> 19:58.377
I need you to become my
 believer right away!

19:55.507 --> 19:58.377
I can see up your skirt.

19:59.287 --> 20:03.417
Then... would you become my 
believer if I gave you a peek?

20:03.417 --> 20:05.347
How can you even suggest that?

20:05.347 --> 20:07.257
Please, please, please!

20:07.257 --> 20:08.867
Please become my believer!

20:08.867 --> 20:10.847
Please!

20:10.847 --> 20:14.557
You're the only one who can!

20:12.147 --> 20:14.557
<i>This couldn't sound any shadier.</i>

20:14.557 --> 20:16.407
Please, please!

20:15.357 --> 20:17.357
WILL YOU BECOME THE GODDESS'S BELIEVER?

20:15.357 --> 20:17.357
YES

20:15.357 --> 20:17.357
NO

20:16.407 --> 20:20.857
<i>Still, it's the first time anyone 
has bothered trying to recruit me.</i>

20:18.067 --> 20:19.847
Please!

20:19.847 --> 20:22.867
I'm begging you!

20:21.467 --> 20:22.867
All right.

20:22.867 --> 20:23.617
Huh?

20:25.447 --> 20:26.897
I'll become your believer.

20:26.897 --> 20:27.617
Huh?

20:27.617 --> 20:29.607
Oh, are you sure?

20:29.607 --> 20:30.627
Yes.

20:30.627 --> 20:31.867
Yay!

20:31.867 --> 20:33.107
Woo! Woo!

20:33.107 --> 20:35.377
Yay! Yahoo!

20:33.107 --> 20:35.377
<i>The dignity she started 
with feels like a lie.</i>

20:35.377 --> 20:38.377
Then could you lend me your 
Soul Book for a moment?

20:38.377 --> 20:41.087
Oh, here you go.

20:45.887 --> 20:48.387
The Goddess's First Believer?

20:48.777 --> 20:50.507
There's no one but me?

20:50.507 --> 20:52.577
I used to have more in the past, you know.

20:52.577 --> 20:54.547
You're the first believer 
I've had in a long time.

20:54.547 --> 20:56.177
Consider it an honor!

20:57.027 --> 20:59.647
So, what about your blessing?

21:00.127 --> 21:03.447
If you offer prayers to me every day, 
then you'll have it in due time!

21:03.987 --> 21:05.307
I see.

21:05.307 --> 21:06.677
Oh, but don't worry!

21:06.677 --> 21:08.407
I'll give you this instead.

21:08.787 --> 21:11.057
I won't forgive you if you lose it, though!

21:11.057 --> 21:13.417
Be sure to hold onto it while you pray.

21:13.737 --> 21:17.207
Well, please call on on me 
if you're ever in trouble, okay?

21:17.207 --> 21:17.707
Huh?

21:17.707 --> 21:20.227
Hey, don't you have any directions for me?

21:20.227 --> 21:22.187
You like open worlds more, right?

21:22.187 --> 21:24.367
You're well-informed.

21:24.367 --> 21:25.687
Just one thing, then.

21:26.417 --> 21:27.997
Please grow stronger!

21:27.997 --> 21:30.437
I won't forgive you if you die too easily.

21:31.297 --> 21:34.187
Because you're my only believer, okay?

21:34.547 --> 21:37.187
I have high hopes for you.

21:37.837 --> 21:39.197
High hopes?

21:39.457 --> 21:41.857
Well, good luck!

21:49.377 --> 21:49.947
Hm?

21:51.387 --> 21:52.697
The goblin's dagger...

21:53.877 --> 21:55.597
So that wasn't a dream.

21:56.757 --> 21:58.077
Goddess,

21:58.077 --> 21:59.677
thank you very much!

22:01.187 --> 22:04.207
I'll do my best to live up 
to your expectations!

23:35.087 --> 23:40.057
EPISODE 2
MAKOTO TAKATSUKI 
EMBARKS ON A QUEST
